  "sourceTitle": "London Broil Bake",
  "sourceText": "London Broil Bake\nBy: Barnaby Dorfman\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 London Broil\n1 can cream of mushroom soup\n1 package dry onion soup mix\n6 potatoes, chunked\n6 carrots, sliced\n1 small onion\n3/4 cup water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine meat and all other ingredients. Cover with foil. Bake at 350 degrees for 3 hours. Eat and enjoy!",
